  (text "Private operations: valid local six-digit PIN grant + per-request confirmation.\nNo biometric path. SE-native PIN ACLs and durable retries must be qualified; Root owns keypad.\nPrecharge attempts durably; uncertain writes deny. AEAD does not alone prevent rollback.\nSE certification does not certify MCU, PCB, PIN execution path or complete product."
    (at 184 264 0)
    (effects
